A modern landing page with hero, features, pricing, testimonials, and CTA sections.

## Getting Started

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Open http://localhost:3000 in your browser.

## Sections

- **Hero** — Value proposition with metrics
- **Features** — 6 feature cards with icons
- **Pricing** — 3-tier pricing (Starter / Pro / Enterprise)
- **Testimonials** — Social proof with quotes
- **CTA** — Email signup form
- **Footer** — Multi-column with links

## Stack

- **HTML5** — Semantic, accessible markup
- **CSS3** — Custom properties, Grid, Flexbox, gradients
- **JavaScript (ES Modules)** — Smooth scroll, sticky header, scroll animations
- **[Vite](https://vitejs.dev/)** — Build tool and dev server

